inal stage of preparations right now, and that’s why we’d love for you to help us polish the game. Join the Community Playtest We’re opening sign-ups for a Community Playtest! Play the build before anyone else, alone or with your friends, and tell us what","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:07:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029177","verified_at":"2026-10-21T18:37:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704000-1846651706695333","game_id":"steam-4704000","kind":"announcement","title":"🎃 Spooky Special Contest","summary":"Hey, everyone!Our shark put a sign in the window promising a “super cool Halloween special,” talked it up to every customer who swam in, and then realized the shelf behind the counter is completely empty. So what’s the special? You get to decide.📋 Your taskJoin our Discord, find the comics templates in the events channel, and come up with the Halloween item Shark Mart is selling this season. Put it on the empty shelf in the last panel of the comic. Draw it, paste it, build it out of screenshots,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:48:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704000-1846651706691485","game_id":"steam-4704000","kind":"announcement","title":"🦈 NEXT FEST IS LIVE!","summary":"Hey, Not Sharks!The cover is blown... in the best way possible! Shark Mart has officially infiltrated Steam Next Fest and your squad has been cleared for an undercover mission on the ocean floor 🔍Here is your mission briefing:🎮PLAY THE DEMO✍️ LEAVE A REVIEW❤️ WISHLIST THE GAMEFIELD REPORT: PATCH NOTESWe’ve polished our cover story based on your previous intel. Read the more detailed patch notes for the Updated Demo below 👇What’s New:🎣 Fishing Rod: Lure fish without raising suspicion (if you’re q","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:01:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691485","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704000-1844751498234514","game_id":"steam-4704000","kind":"announcement","title":"THE DEMO IS LIVE!","summary":"Hey hey, everyone, great news today! First off, shoutout to everyone who took part in our playtests over the past few months. Your feedback shaped a lot of this demo, and the game wouldn't be what it is today without your support. The demo is officially here, and you can dive in and stay awhile right now. So go ahead and run your own shop, keep the Orca Police off your back, send the occasional customer down to the basement, and split the shifts with your team. Co-op is preferred, but solo works","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T15:00:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234514","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704000-1844115010504495","game_id":"steam-4704000","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO DATE REVEAL","summary":"Hey everyone, how's it going?Guess what? Our first demo is launching in just a few days! It goes live on September 29 at 17:00 CEST, free and open to everyone. Take a dolphin mask, round up your crew, and open your own underwater shop!There's a bunch of fun new stuff in there we'll tell you more about once the demo is actually out. And remember! The Orca Police are always watching, so smile wide and swim smart 🐬 Be sure to join our Discord to chat with the team, get sneak peeks, and be the first","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T15:06:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504495","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704000-1842846814453339","game_id":"steam-4704000","kind":"announcement","title":"Our playtest is closing up","summary":"Hey NOT Sharks! That's a wrap on this playtest. Hope you had fun and enjoyed checking out the game!Some numbers for you:≈ 4k people played across both playtestsMedian playtime 57 minutesAnd the feedback was awesome too. A lot of you talked about wanting more content and customization, more shark/whale interactions, and more ways to expand the shop. Thanks for all of it, we really appreciate you taking the time.Most of the issues from the first playtest have been fixed, and we've already got a cl","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T15:03:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453339","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704000-1842212951310491","game_id":"steam-4704000","kind":"announcement","title":"🦈 SECOND CLOSED PLAYTEST IS LIVE","summary":"Hello everyone! The second closed playtest is here, and this time your shop's had a serious glow-up. Slip on that dolphin mask, round up your crew, and get back behind the counter. Here's what's new since the first playtest:Expanded the store catalog to 9 products across three progression cardsAdded a new three-slot Small Shelf and rebalanced early-game pricesAdded full store customization for walls, floors, exterior, second floor, laundry, and renovation levelAdded shark customization with sepa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T15:00:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310491","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704000-1840944183777035","game_id":"steam-4704000","kind":"announcement","title":"The playtest has closed","summary":"Hey everyone! Our closed playtest is done for this round, and now we're diving deep into your feedback as we begin working on the next version of the game. The numbers:🦈 More than 1,300 people played ⏱️ Median playtime 43 minutes 📈 Wishlists grew by about 70K total Thank you for all the feedback! We're taking it all with us to sharpen the game before the next playtest. In the meantime, join our Discord to stay in the loop.There will be more playtests in the future, so if you missed this one, kee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T15:02:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183777035","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4704000-1840310314342156","game_id":"steam-4704000","kind":"announcement","title":"🦈 Closed Playtest Is Live Now","summary":"Hey, shopkeepers! The shelves are stocked, the whales are lining up for their glow-up, and the basement is... let's just say it's fully operational. The Shark Mart closed playtest is live right now, and we'd love for you to work the counter with us.For anyone just swimming in: Shark Mart is a co-op sim where you play a shark posing as a perfectly friendly dolphin, running a perfectly legitimate underwater shop. Serve your customers, buff up the whales, and maybe, very quietly, turn a few unsuspe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T15:00:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community